    "paragraph": "AgenticMobility introduced an open-source framework that integrates persistent large language model agents with the MATSim traffic simulator to model interactions between dynamic travelers and transport managers. ScaleTraj presented an autoregressive Transformer model that separates individual trajectory generation into a scale selection step and a scale-aware destination step. Additionally, a scoping review synthesised 107 articles on active mobilities of care in urban contexts across themes of movement, determinants, meaning, and experience.",
